         The sensor gestures have two more entries than the case keys.
         "No action" here means the gesture is discarded, not that it goes
         through: letting the arrow keys pass would move focus inside apps on
         every brush of the finger. Whoever wants them picks "Arrow keys".
    -->
    <string-array name="fp_action_entries">
